    "No MCP servers yet. MCP servers give the agent extra tools (GitHub, databases, browsers…). Pick one from the catalog below, or click Add Server at the top of the page.": "尚无 MCP 服务器。MCP 服务器为智能体提供额外工具（GitHub、数据库、浏览器……）。从下方目录中选择一个，或点击页面顶部的 Add Server。",
    "No account or credentials needed — tools are available as soon as the\nsession restarts.": "无需账户或凭据——会话重启后工具即可使用。",
    "No account or credentials needed — tools are available as soon as the\nsession restarts.\n\nSearch only — booking and payment happen on kiwi.com via the returned\nlinks, never in-conversation.": "无需账户或凭据——会话重启后工具即可使用。\n\n仅限搜索——预订和支付通过返回的链接在 kiwi.com 上完成，绝不在对话中进行。",
    "No account or credentials needed — tools are available as soon as the\nsession restarts.\n\nSearch only — booking happens on the linked booking sites, never\nin-conversation.": "无需账户或凭据——会话重启后工具即可使用。\n\n仅限搜索——预订通过链接的预订网站完成，绝不在对话中进行。",
    "No account or credentials needed — tools are available as soon as the\nsession restarts.\n\nWorks anonymously with rate limits; for higher limits create an API key\nat context7.com/dashboard and add it as a Bearer header via\nmcp_servers.context7.headers in config.yaml.": "无需账户或凭据——会话重启后工具即可用。\n\n匿名使用有速率限制；如需更高限额，请在 context7.com/dashboard 创建 API key，并通过 config.yaml 中的 mcp_servers.context7.headers 将其添加为 Bearer 头。",
