    "On first connection Hermes opens a browser to authorize with\nAirtable (or run `hermes mcp login airtable`). Approve access,\nthen restart the session so tools load.": "首次连接时，Hermes 会打开浏览器以通过 Airtable 授权（或运行 `hermes mcp login airtable`）。批准访问后，重启会话以加载工具。",
    "On first connection Hermes opens a browser to authorize with\nAlgolia (or run `hermes mcp login algolia`). Approve access,\nthen restart the session so tools load.": "首次连接时，Hermes 会打开浏览器以通过 Algolia 授权（或运行 `hermes mcp login algolia`）。批准访问后，重启会话以加载工具。",
    "On first connection Hermes opens a browser to authorize with\nAmplitude (or run `hermes mcp login amplitude`). Approve access,\nthen restart the session so tools load.\n\nEU-resident orgs: change mcp_servers.amplitude.url to\nhttps://mcp.eu.amplitude.com/mcp in config.yaml.": "首次连接时 Hermes 会打开浏览器以通过 Amplitude 授权（或运行 `hermes mcp login amplitude`）。批准访问后，重启会话以加载工具。\n\n欧盟地区的组织：在 config.yaml 中将 mcp_servers.amplitude.url 改为 https://mcp.eu.amplitude.com/mcp。",
    "On first connection Hermes opens a browser to authorize with\nAtlassian (or run `hermes mcp login atlassian`). Approve access,\nthen restart the session so tools load.": "首次连接时，Hermes 会打开浏览器以通过 Atlassian 授权（或运行 `hermes mcp login atlassian`）。批准访问后，重启会话以加载工具。",
