    "On first connection Hermes opens a browser to authorize with\nPlaid (or run `hermes mcp login plaid`). Approve access,\nthen restart the session so tools load.": "首次连接时，Hermes 会打开浏览器以通过 Plaid 进行授权（或运行 `hermes mcp login plaid`）。批准访问后，重启会话以加载工具。",
    "On first connection Hermes opens a browser to authorize with\nPostman (or run `hermes mcp login postman`). Approve access,\nthen restart the session so tools load.": "首次连接时，Hermes 会打开浏览器以通过 Postman 进行授权（或运行 `hermes mcp login postman`）。批准访问后，重启会话以加载工具。",
    "On first connection Hermes opens a browser to authorize with\nPrisma Postgres (or run `hermes mcp login prisma-postgres`). Approve access,\nthen restart the session so tools load.": "首次连接时，Hermes 会打开浏览器以通过 Prisma Postgres 进行授权（或运行 `hermes mcp login prisma-postgres`）。批准访问后，重启会话以加载工具。",
    "On first connection Hermes opens a browser to authorize with\nRailway (or run `hermes mcp login railway`). Approve access,\nthen restart the session so tools load.": "首次连接时，Hermes 会打开浏览器以通过 Railway 进行授权（或运行 `hermes mcp login railway`）。批准访问后，重启会话以加载工具。",
    "On first connection Hermes opens a browser to authorize with\nSemgrep (or run `hermes mcp login semgrep`). Approve access,\nthen restart the session so tools load.": "首次连接时，Hermes 会打开浏览器以通过\nSemgrep 进行授权（或运行 `hermes mcp login semgrep`）。批准访问后，\n重启会话以加载工具。",
    "On first connection Hermes opens a browser to authorize with\nSentry (or run `hermes mcp login sentry`). Approve access,\nthen restart the session so tools load.": "首次连接时，Hermes 会打开浏览器以通过\nSentry 进行授权（或运行 `hermes mcp login sentry`）。批准访问后，\n重启会话以加载工具。",
    "On first connection Hermes opens a browser to authorize with\nSquare (or run `hermes mcp login square`). Approve access,\nthen restart the session so tools load.": "首次连接时，Hermes 会打开浏览器以通过\nSquare 进行授权（或运行 `hermes mcp login square`）。批准访问后，\n重启会话以加载工具。",
    "On first connection Hermes opens a browser to authorize with\nStrava (or run `hermes mcp login strava`). Approve access,\nthen restart the session so tools load.\n\nRequires a Strava subscription.": "首次连接时，Hermes 会打开浏览器以通过\nStrava 进行授权（或运行 `hermes mcp login strava`）。批准访问后，\n重启会话以加载工具。\n\n需要 Strava 订阅。",
    "On first connection Hermes opens a browser to authorize with\nStripe (or run `hermes mcp login stripe`). Approve access,\nthen restart the session so tools load.": "首次连接时，Hermes 会打开浏览器以通过\nStripe 进行授权（或运行 `hermes mcp login stripe`）。批准访问后，\n重启会话以加载工具。",
    "On first connection Hermes opens a browser to authorize with\nSupabase (or run `hermes mcp login supabase`). Approve access,\nthen restart the session so tools load.": "首次连接时，Hermes 会打开浏览器以通过\nSupabase 进行授权（或运行 `hermes mcp login supabase`）。批准访问后，\n重启会话以加载工具。",
    "On first connection Hermes opens a browser to authorize with\nTodoist (or run `hermes mcp login todoist`). Approve access,\nthen restart the session so tools load.": "首次连接时，Hermes 会打开浏览器以通过\nTodoist 进行授权（或运行 `hermes mcp login todoist`）。批准访问后，\n重启会话以加载工具。",
    "On first connection Hermes opens a browser to authorize with\nTwelve Data (or run `hermes mcp login twelve-data`). Approve access,\nthen restart the session so tools load.": "首次连接时，Hermes 会打开浏览器以通过\nTwelve Data 进行授权（或运行 `hermes mcp login twelve-data`）。批准访问后，\n重启会话以加载工具。",
    "On first connection Hermes opens a browser to authorize with\nVercel (or run `hermes mcp login vercel`). Approve access,\nthen restart the session so tools load.": "首次连接时，Hermes 会打开浏览器以通过\nVercel 进行授权（或运行 `hermes mcp login vercel`）。批准访问后，\n重启会话以加载工具。",
    "On first connection Hermes opens a browser to authorize with\nWebflow (or run `hermes mcp login webflow`). Approve access,\nthen restart the session so tools load.": "首次连接时，Hermes 会打开浏览器以通过\nWebflow 进行授权（或运行 `hermes mcp login webflow`）。批准访问后，\n重启会话以加载工具。",
    "On first connection Hermes opens a browser to authorize with\nWordPress.com (or run `hermes mcp login wordpress-com`). Approve access,\nthen restart the session so tools load.": "首次连接时，Hermes 会打开浏览器以通过 WordPress.com 进行授权（或运行 `hermes mcp login wordpress-com`）。批准访问后，重启会话以加载工具。",
    "On first connection Hermes opens a browser to authorize with\nmonday.com (or run `hermes mcp login monday`). Approve access,\nthen restart the session so tools load.": "首次连接时，Hermes 会打开浏览器以通过 monday.com 进行授权（或运行 `hermes mcp login monday`）。批准访问后，重启会话以加载工具。",
    "On first connection, Hermes will open a browser to authenticate with Linear.\nAfter auth, restart your Hermes session so the Linear tools are loaded.\n\nYou can re-run the tool checklist any time with:\n  hermes mcp configure linear": "首次连接时，Hermes 会打开浏览器以通过 Linear 进行身份验证。验证后，重启 Hermes 会话以加载 Linear 工具。\n\n你可以随时重新运行工具检查清单：\n  hermes mcp configure linear",
