    "Requirement: git workflow commands ≥ 50; tool calls in one session ≥ 500.": "要求：git 工作流命令 ≥ 50；单个会话中的工具调用 ≥ 500。",
    "Requirement: image generation or vision tool calls. Tier ladder: Copper 100, Silver 300, Gold 1000, Diamond 3000, Olympian 8000.": "要求：图像生成或视觉工具调用。等级阶梯：铜 100，银 300，金 1000，钻石 3000，奥林匹斯 8000。",
    "Requirement: lifetime Hermes tool calls. Tier ladder: Copper 1000, Silver 3000, Gold 8000, Diamond 20000, Olympian 50000.": "要求：Hermes 工具调用总数。等级阶梯：铜 1000，银 3000，金 8000，钻石 20000，奥林匹斯 50000。",
    "Requirement: lifetime background process operations. Tier ladder: Copper 300, Silver 800, Gold 2000, Diamond 6000, Olympian 15000.": "要求：终身后台进程操作。等级阶梯：Copper 300，Silver 800，Gold 2000，Diamond 6000，Olympian 15000。",
    "Requirement: lifetime browser automation calls. Tier ladder: Copper 75, Silver 200, Gold 600, Diamond 1500, Olympian 4000.": "要求：终身浏览器自动化调用。等级阶梯：Copper 75，Silver 200，Gold 600，Diamond 1500，Olympian 4000。",
    "Requirement: lifetime delegate_task calls. Tier ladder: Copper 5, Silver 40, Gold 100, Diamond 1000, Olympian 5000.": "要求：终身 delegate_task 调用。等级阶梯：Copper 5，Silver 40，Gold 100，Diamond 1000，Olympian 5000。",
    "Requirement: lifetime read_file/search_files calls. Tier ladder: Copper 750, Silver 2000, Gold 6000, Diamond 15000, Olympian 50000.": "要求：终身 read_file/search_files 调用。等级阶梯：Copper 750，Silver 2000，Gold 6000，Diamond 15000，Olympian 50000。",
    "Requirement: lifetime scheduled-job operations. Tier ladder: Copper 1000, Silver 3000, Gold 8000, Diamond 20000, Olympian 50000.": "要求：终身定时任务操作。等级阶梯：Copper 1000，Silver 3000，Gold 8000，Diamond 20000，Olympian 50000。",
    "Requirement: lifetime targeted patch edits. Tier ladder: Copper 250, Silver 750, Gold 2000, Diamond 6000, Olympian 15000.": "要求：终身定向补丁编辑。等级阶梯：Copper 250，Silver 750，Gold 2000，Diamond 6000，Olympian 15000。",
    "Requirement: lifetime terminal calls. Tier ladder: Copper 750, Silver 2000, Gold 6000, Diamond 15000, Olympian 50000.": "要求：终身终端调用。等级阶梯：Copper 750，Silver 2000，Gold 6000，Diamond 15000，Olympian 50000。",
    "Requirement: lifetime web_extract calls. Tier ladder: Copper 100, Silver 300, Gold 1000, Diamond 3000, Olympian 8000.": "要求：终身 web_extract 调用。等级阶梯：Copper 100，Silver 300，Gold 1000，Diamond 3000，Olympian 8000。",
    "Requirement: lifetime web_search/web_extract calls. Tier ladder: Copper 400, Silver 1200, Gold 3000, Diamond 8000, Olympian 20000.": "要求：终身 web_search/web_extract 调用。等级阶梯：Copper 400，Silver 1200，Gold 3000，Diamond 8000，Olympian 20000。",
    "Requirement: log inspections. Tier ladder: Copper 1000, Silver 3000, Gold 8000, Diamond 20000, Olympian 50000.": "要求：日志检查。等级阶梯：Copper 1000，Silver 3000，Gold 8000，Diamond 20000，Olympian 50000。",
    "Requirement: memory or Mnemosyne tool events. Tier ladder: Copper 100, Silver 300, Gold 1000, Diamond 3000, Olympian 8000.": "要求：记忆或 Mnemosyne 工具事件。等级阶梯：Copper 100，Silver 300，Gold 1000，Diamond 3000，Olympian 8000。",
    "Requirement: messages in one session. Tier ladder: Copper 300, Silver 600, Gold 1200, Diamond 2500, Olympian 6000.": "要求：单个会话中的消息数。等级阶梯：Copper 300，Silver 600，Gold 1200，Diamond 2500，Olympian 6000。",
    "Requirement: missing auth/config/environment-variable events. Tier ladder: Copper 5000, Silver 15000, Gold 40000, Diamond 100000, Olympian 250000.": "要求：缺失认证/配置/环境变量事件。等级阶梯：铜 5000，银 15000，金 40000，钻石 100000，奥林匹斯 250000。",
    "Requirement: model/provider-related activity. Tier ladder: Copper 10000, Silver 30000, Gold 80000, Diamond 200000, Olympian 500000.": "要求：模型/提供方相关活动。等级阶梯：Copper 10000，Silver 30000，Gold 80000，Diamond 200000，Olympian 500000。",
    "Requirement: model/provider-related activity. Tier ladder: Copper 250, Silver 750, Gold 2000, Diamond 6000, Olympian 15000.": "要求：模型/提供方相关活动。等级阶梯：Copper 250，Silver 750，Gold 2000，Diamond 6000，Olympian 15000。",
