    "Requirement: restart/reload actions after error clusters ≥ 50; error/failed/traceback messages observed ≥ 4000.": "要求：错误集群后重启/重载操作 ≥ 50；观察到错误/失败/回溯消息 ≥ 4000。",
    "Requirement: rollback/checkpoint recovery mentions. Tier ladder: Copper 500, Silver 1500, Gold 4000, Diamond 10000, Olympian 25000.": "要求：回滚/检查点恢复提及。等级阶梯：铜 500，银 1500，金 4000，钻石 10000，奥林匹斯 25000。",
    "Requirement: screenshot, Playwright, PNG, or vision-inspection activity. Tier ladder: Copper 50, Silver 150, Gold 500, Diamond 1500, Olympian 5000.": "要求：截图、Playwright、PNG 或视觉检查活动。等级阶梯：Copper 50，Silver 150，Gold 500，Diamond 1500，Olympian 5000。",
    "Requirement: sessions started late night or before dawn. Tier ladder: Copper 25, Silver 75, Gold 200, Diamond 600, Olympian 1500.": "要求：深夜或黎明前启动的会话。等级阶梯：Copper 25，Silver 75，Gold 200，Diamond 600，Olympian 1500。",
