    "Requirement: skill_manage create/patch/delete operations. Tier ladder: Copper 25, Silver 75, Gold 200, Diamond 600, Olympian 1500.": "要求：skill_manage 创建/修补/删除操作。等级阶梯：Copper 25，Silver 75，Gold 200，Diamond 600，Olympian 1500。",
    "Requirement: terminal calls in one session ≥ 180; file/search/patch calls in one session ≥ 120; web search/extract or browser calls in one session ≥ 60.": "要求：单个会话中终端调用 ≥ 180；文件/搜索/补丁调用 ≥ 120；网络搜索/提取或浏览器调用 ≥ 60。",
    "Requirement: test/check/verification command mentions. Tier ladder: Copper 100, Silver 300, Gold 800, Diamond 2400, Olympian 6000.": "要求：测试/检查/验证命令提及。等级阶梯：Copper 100，Silver 300，Gold 800，Diamond 2400，Olympian 6000。",
    "Requirement: text-to-speech or voice tool calls. Tier ladder: Copper 10, Silver 30, Gold 100, Diamond 300, Olympian 800.": "要求：文本转语音或语音工具调用。等级阶梯：Copper 10，Silver 30，Gold 100，Diamond 300，Olympian 800。",
    "Requirement: tiny typo-style fixes after error clusters ≥ 5; error/failed/traceback messages observed ≥ 4000.": "要求：错误簇 ≥ 5 后的小型拼写式修复；观察到错误/失败/回溯消息 ≥ 4000。",
    "Requirement: tool calls in one session. Tier ladder: Copper 200, Silver 500, Gold 1200, Diamond 3000, Olympian 8000.": "要求：单个会话中的工具调用。等级阶梯：Copper 200，Silver 500，Gold 1200，Diamond 3000，Olympian 8000。",
    "Requirement: toolset or tool-family mentions. Tier ladder: Copper 20, Silver 60, Gold 200, Diamond 600, Olympian 1500.": "要求：工具集或工具系列提及。等级阶梯：Copper 20，Silver 60，Gold 200，Diamond 600，Olympian 1500。",
